WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.367 --> 00:00:03.303
-Guys, the election
is less than a month away.

00:00:03.303 --> 00:00:05.805
Now, Joe Biden has a steady lead
over Donald Trump, nationally,

00:00:05.805 --> 00:00:08.508
but Trump is polling better
with certain groups.

00:00:08.508 --> 00:00:09.809
To break these numbers down,

00:00:09.809 --> 00:00:12.378
it's time for a segment called
"Leaderboard 2020."

00:00:12.378 --> 00:00:17.583
♪♪

00:00:17.583 --> 00:00:19.218
Let's check out the first poll.

00:00:19.218 --> 00:00:22.121 line:0%
Joe Biden has a big lead
with black women,

00:00:22.121 --> 00:00:24.123 line:0%
but Trump is leading with
white women

00:00:24.123 --> 00:00:26.926 line:0%
who only know one black woman.

00:00:26.926 --> 00:00:30.196 line:0%
Next up, Trump is polling better
with people

00:00:30.196 --> 00:00:32.665 line:0%
who spread conspiracy theories
on Facebook.

00:00:32.665 --> 00:00:34.000 line:0%
Biden is leading with people

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:36.702 line:0%
who only use the computer
at the library.

00:00:36.702 --> 00:00:40.439 line:0%
Next up, Biden is leading with
healthcare workers.

00:00:40.439 --> 00:00:42.275 line:0%
Trump is leading with people
who think taking

00:00:42.275 --> 00:00:45.945 line:0%
NyQuil and DayQuil at the
same time cancel each other out.

00:00:45.945 --> 00:00:49.716 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:49.716 --> 00:00:51.217 line:0%
Let's take a look
at another poll.

00:00:51.217 --> 00:00:54.053 line:0%
Trump is doing better
with the 1%.

00:00:54.053 --> 00:00:56.623 line:0%
Biden is leading with people
who remember when you could get

00:00:56.623 --> 00:00:59.091 line:0%
a gallon of milk for 1 cent.

00:00:59.091 --> 00:01:02.361 line:0%
Next up, this poll found
that Biden is leading with

00:01:02.361 --> 00:01:05.531 line:0%
people under 45, while Trump is
leading with people who

00:01:05.531 --> 00:01:08.634 line:0%
post their Google searches as
their Facebook status.

00:01:08.634 --> 00:01:14.107 line:0%
And, finally, Biden leads with
non-white voters,

00:01:14.107 --> 00:01:15.741 line:0%
but Trump leads with
white people

00:01:15.741 --> 00:01:17.610 line:0%
who have wooden kitchen signs
that say

00:01:17.610 --> 00:01:20.646 line:0%
"Dream big, eat bigger"
in cursive font.

00:01:20.646 --> 00:01:23.917 line:0%
That's all the time we have for
"Leaderboard 2020."

